{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-01-10 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT AND TEVET COLLABORATE TO PROVIDE REAL-TIME SIGNAL ANALYSIS FOR ELECTROMAGNETIC SPECTRUM OPERATIONS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, AND TEVET HAVE PARTNERED TO ADDRESS THE NEED FOR REAL-TIME ANALYSIS OF SIGNALS IN ELECTROMAGNETIC SPECTRUM OPERATIONS (EMSO) APPLICATIONS. THE GAP-LESS, REAL-TIME CAPABILITY OF THE COLLABORATION PROVIDES THE ABILITY TO PROTECT AND DEFEND OPERATIONS IN THE INCREASINGLY COMPLEX ELECTROMAGNETIC (EM) SPECTRUM ENVIRONMENT.'}